lternate envelopes would break MARATHON-18 invitation UI and graders.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-235236-app-architect-1--6acfd1e3/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":140,"content":"#### 3i. Acceptance Criteria","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-234841-app-architect-1--b555c9ae/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":131,"content":"#### 3i. Acceptance Criteria","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-234424-app-architect-1--56b8fed5/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":131,"content":"#### 3i. Acceptance Criteria","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-233543-backend-dev-1--5fd5e7e5/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":71,"content":"This task completes workspace tenancy beyond create/list/detail (MARATHON-5): authenticated **members** can list workspace membership; **admins/owners** can PATCH `name` / `join_mode`; **admins/owners** can change other members’ roles under a strict hierarchy; and the **owner** alone can transfer ownership to an existing **admin** (previous owner becomes admin). It locks `MemberObj`, the four REST seams SPA settings (MARATHON-18) and channel/invitation authz (MARATHON-7/12) depend on, and keeps `workspaces.owner_id` synchronized with `workspace_members.role='owner'`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":93,"content":"- Flat `MemberObj` with denormalized username/display_name matches MARATHON-5’s preference for flat workspace JSON while giving MARATHON-18 enough to render role rows.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-231530-app-architect-1--75625568/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":131,"content":"#### 3i. Acceptance Criteria","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-231142-app-architect-1--6d670797/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber"