mbers/invitations only; profile is a different surface |\\n| Groups CRUD UI | MARATHON-12 groups API exists but is not in this task description |\\n| React settings app | Diverges from M16 zero-build convention |\\n\\n### Trade-off accepted\\n\\nChannel add-member needs a **small backend POST** that did not ship in M7. This design locks that seam so SPA and server can be implemented in parallel; if the implementer is frontend-only, the lead should keep `frontend` and optionally add a short backend subtask — **do not** fake\\n\\nYou are cwd-ed into a DISPOSABLE detached checkout of the candidate commit. Review it against the design and acceptance criteria, then write CRITIC-VERDICT.txt in the current directory containing EXACTLY one first line:\\nREVIEW attempt=1 commit=6c6170f7b7fb6d4ccb358c5af71c7031f3d20512 APPROVED — <reason>\\nor\\nREVIEW attempt=1 commit=6c6170f7b7fb6d4ccb358c5af71c7031f3d20512 CHANGES-REQUESTED — <reason>\\n\\nAddress this request using the lead mode conventions above.\\n</user_query>\"}]}}\n{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I'll review the candidate against the MARATHON-18 design by inspecting the diff and the settings UI implementation.\"},{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"name\":\"Shell\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"cd /work/critic-MARATHON-18-1 && git log --oneline d088d3ef8892588e7089c8b4d20b600d4624cb7a..6c6170f7b7fb6d4ccb358c5af71c7031f3d20512 && git diff --stat d088d3ef8892588e7089c8b4d20b600d4624cb7a..6c6170f7b7fb6d4ccb358c5af71c7031f3d20512 && ls -la && ls static/js/ 2>/dev/null; ls EXPERIMENTS.md 2>/dev/null; find . -name '*MARATHON*' -o -name '*ACCEPT*' -o -name '*design*' 2>/dev/null | head -50\",\"description\":\"Inspect commit range and project layout\"}},{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"name\":\"Glob\",\"input\":{\"glob_pattern\":\"**/*.{js,html,py,md}\"}},{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"name\":\"Grep\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"workspace-settings|channel-settings|settings-|invitation-|create-invitation\",\"gl