ed":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":160,"content":"| `channel-member-row` | One row per `UserObj` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":166,"content":"Each `channel-member-row` **must** expose `data-user-id=\"{id}\"` (UserObj `id`).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":187,"content":"| **Client** | On Members tab select / modal open: `GET` members. While slow: show `settings-members-loading` or keep prior rows. On **200**: render rows ordered as server returns; every row has `role-badge`; editable rows get `role-select` preselected to current role. On change of `role-select`: `PATCH` `{role}` immediately (or on explicit apply — **prefer immediate**). On **403/400**: revert select to last known role; show `settings-members-error`. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":190,"content":"**Who sees `role-select`:**","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":194,"content":"| owner | admin/member/guest | `role-select` enabled |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":196,"content":"| admin | member/guest | `role-select` enabled |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":337,"content":"| `static/js/settings_ui.js` | Workspace + channel modal controllers; tab switching; all settings API calls; role-select / invitation / topic / archive / add-member handlers; exports `initSettingsUi(ctx)` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":460,"content":"4. Members tab lists all workspace members with `role-badge`; owner/admin can change permitted roles via `role-select`; forbidden changes show error and do **not** leave a lying UI role.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":464,"content":"8. With an active public/private channel, channel settings shows members (`channel-member-row`), allows topic save for authorized callers, and owner can archive/unarchive with UI reflecting `is_archived`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":17,"totalMatchedLines":17,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-93478434-a2fb-4562-89a0-6fef230b19fe-32\nfc_6d7a960b-83dd-9cec-8194-58b81c18226b_2","startedAtMs":"1787447922058","completedAtMs":"1787447922732"},"model_call_id":"51cc01bb-5c2b-48d1-8a21-dc3abf5ea0b5-10-yswo","session_id":"a42df522-cd26-417c-87e5-65513de2eb14","timestamp_ms":1787447922754}
