{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-9a4b171a-1d44-4ca9-8e7c-a47a17658f6d-36\nfc_77a21461-fac3-9054-974d-dde702edeacd_1","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/tmp/m18-design.md","offset":100,"limit":80},"result":{"success":{"content":"#### Workspace settings — members\n\n| `data-testid` | Role |\n|---------------|------|\n| `settings-members-list` | Container for member rows |\n| `settings-member-row` | One row per `MemberObj` (may appear multiple times) |\n| `role-badge` | Read-only role label on a row (always present) |\n| `role-select` | `<select>` to change role when actor may edit that row; **absent or `disabled`** when actor cannot |\n| `settings-members-error` | Visible error for list/PATCH failures |\n| `settings-members-loading` | Optional loading marker while `GET .../members` in flight |\n| `settings-transfer-owner` | Owner-only control to transfer ownership (confirm + target admin) |\n| `settings-transfer-owner-select` | Admin target picker |\n| `settings-transfer-owner-submit` | Confirm transfer |\n| `settings-transfer-error` | Transfer error text |\n\nEach `settings-member-row` **must** expose `data-user-id=\"{user_id}\"`.\n\n`role-select` options: `admin`, `member`, `guest` only (never `owner` — ownership uses transfer).\n\n#### Workspace settings — invitations\n\n| `data-testid` | Role |\n|---------------|------|\n| `create-invitation-form` | Same as DOM id; create form |\n| `invitation-max-uses` | Optional number input (default server 1 if empty) |\n| `invitation-expires-seconds` | Optional expiry seconds input |\n| `invitation-username` | Optional targeted username |\n| `invitation-create-submit` | Create submit control |\n| `invitation-create-error` | Visible create error |\n| `invitation-list` | Active invitations list container |\n| `invitation-row` | One row per active invitation |\n| `invitation-code` | Displays `InvitationObj.code` (copyable text) |\n| `invitation-revoke` | Revoke control on a row |\n| `invitation-list-error` | List/revoke error |\n\nEach `invitation-row` **must** expose `data-invitation-code=\"{code}\"` (and/or `data-invitation-id`).\n\nNon-admin: invitations tab may show a short “Admins only” empty state; create form and list fetch must **not** be required to succeed for members (hide form **or** show 403 in `invitation-list-error` without crashing).\n\n#### Onboarding — accept invitation (redeem)\n\n| `data-testid` | Role |\n|---------------|------|\n| `invitation-accept-form` | Onboarding form (sibling to join-by-slug) |\n| `invitation-accept-code` | Code input |\n| `invitation-accept-submit` | Submit |\n| `invitation-accept-error` | Visible error |\n\n#### Channel settings\n\n| `data-testid` | Role |\n|---------------|------|\n| `channel-settings-modal` | Modal root (also DOM id) |\n| `settings-topic` | Topic `<input>` / textarea |\n| `settings-topic-save` | Save topic |\n| `settings-topic-error` | Topic error (incl. 423 archived) |\n| `settings-archive` | Archive button (owner) |\n| `settings-unarchive` | Unarchive button (owner) |\n| `settings-archive-error` | Archive/unarchive error |\n| `channel-members-list` | Channel members container |\n| `channel-member-row` | One row per `UserObj` |\n| `channel-add-member-input` | Username or user id input for add |\n| `channel-add-member-submit` | Add submit |\n| `channel-add-member-error` | Add error |\n| `channel-members-error` | List error |\n\nEach `channel-member-row` **must** expose `data-user-id=\"{id}\"` (UserObj `id`).\n\nArchive vs unarchive: show the action that matches current `is_archived` (one primary control is enough; the other may stay in DOM but `hidden`).\n\n---\n\n### Seam: SPA ↔ `GET/PATCH /api/workspaces/{slug}` (General tab)\n\n| Side | Responsibility |\n|------|----------------|\n| **Client** | On open: seed `settings-name` / `settings-join-mode` from in-memory `WorkspaceObj`. Save → `PATCH` body subset `{name?, join_mode?}`. Disable `settings-general-save` while in flight. On **200**: replace cached workspace; refresh `workspace-header`. On **400/403**: show `error.message` in `settings-general-error`. On **401**: logout (M16). On **404**: close modal, leave workspace. |\n| **Server** | Unchanged (MARATHON-6). |\n\n**Slow:** keep prior field values; do not clear the form.","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":490,"fileSize":28740,"path":"/tmp/m18-design.md","readRange":{"startLine":100,"endLine":179},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-9a4b171a-1d44-4ca9-8e7c-a47a17658f6d-36\nfc_77a21461-fac3-9054-974d-dde702edeacd_1","startedAtMs":"1787447959351","completedAtMs":"1787447960032"},"model_call_id":"51cc01bb-5c2b-48d1-8a21-dc3abf5ea0b5-12-6ze7","session_id":"a42df522-cd26-417c-87e5-65513de2eb14","timestamp_ms":1787447960057}
